        "diversions": "<p>Light vehicles only -</p><p><strong>Eastbound: </strong>Charles St, Gulgoora Rd, Yarrie Lake Rd, Goobar St, Baranabr St, and Mooloolbar St. </p><p><strong>Westbound:</strong> Mooloobar St, Baranbar St, Goobar St,Yarrie Lake Rd, Gulgoora Rd, and Charles St. </p><p>This route will add up to 20 minutes to your travel time.</p><p><strong>Eastbound from Walgett:</strong> Castlereagh Hwy, Gwydir Hwy to Moree, Boggabilla Rd, Lou Swan Way, and Newell Hwy to Narrabri.</p><p><strong>Westbound from Narrabri:</strong> Newell Hwy to Moree, Lou Swan Way, Boggabilla Rd, Gwydir Hwy, and Castlereagh Hwy to Walgett.</p><p>This route is suitable for all vehicles up to and including AB Triple and B Triple combinations and will add up to 3 hours to your travel time.</p><p>Unless specified otherwise, operators of Class 1,2 &amp; 3 vehicles travelling under a Notice <strong>must</strong> consult their relevant enforceable network map to confirm a suitable <strong>approved</strong> alternative route.</p><p>Operators of Class 1, 2 &amp; 3 vehicles travelling under a Permit <strong>must not</strong> travel off the approved route listed in the permit unless an updated permit is obtained from the NHVR.</p>",
